  |~~ The streams the playground installs, the words of `::stdio`. ~~|
  ::snippet~(::stdio | manifest);

:host/labels
  |~~ How many kinds lie on the playground, the language's and the streams'. ~~|
  ::snippet~(::host | kinds | count);
